# Minimal ASN.1 DER (Distinguished Encoding Rules) decoder for X.509
# certificates and RSA key structures. Implements Tag-Length-Value (TLV)
# parsing for the subset of ASN.1 types used in PKCS#1 and X.509:
#   SEQUENCE, INTEGER, BIT STRING, OCTET STRING, OID, NULL, CONTEXT.
